WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.607 --> 00:00:12.178 line:78%
&gt;&gt; GREG GUTFELD HAS A BIG AND

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:17.684 line:78%
IMPORTANT CHANGE IN HIS LIFE.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:20.053 line:78%
&gt;&gt; LOOK AT THIS.

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.754 line:78%
HMM?

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:26.026 line:78%
HOW'S THAT FOR A RESEMBLANCE?

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:28.595 line:78%
&gt;&gt; SAY HELLO TO GUS GOT FOULED,

00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:28.595 line:78%
AN ADORABLE

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:33.800 line:78%
PUG --

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:36.669 line:78%
JESSICA WHO WILL HAVE ONE.

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:38.638 line:78%
I GOT A GIFT FOR GUS.

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:40.240 line:78%
THERE IS A HALLOWEEN BANDANNA,

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:40.640 line:78%
AN OCTOPUS, AND THIS FOR WHEN HE

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:44.644 line:78%
GETS OLDER.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:45.445 line:78%
IT'S HIS FIRST UNIFORM SOCCER

00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:46.846 line:78%
BALL.

00:00:45.912 --> 00:00:47.680 line:78%
&gt;&gt; IT STRANGE.

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:50.083 line:78%
I HAVEN'T SLEPT BECAUSE ALL HE

00:00:47.781 --> 00:00:50.817 line:78%
DOES -- WE ARE CRATE TRAINING

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.786 line:78%
HIM.

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:54.654 line:78%
ALL HE DOES IS SCREAM IN THIS

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:57.257 line:78%
DEMONIC WAY OLD.

00:00:54.754 --> 00:01:01.728 line:78%
HE'S TINY, BUT IT IS SCREAMING.

00:00:57.357 --> 00:01:05.198 line:78%
I LOOK LIKE A MESS.

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:07.901 line:78%
&gt;&gt; YOU ARE A NEW PARENTS.

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:08.668 line:78%
&gt;&gt; I NOTICED A CHANGE IN YOU

00:01:08.001 --> 00:01:12.072 line:78%
ALREADY.

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:14.808 line:78%
&gt;&gt; BY THE WAY, THOSE ARE NOT MY

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:15.975 line:78%
LEGS.

00:01:15.475 --> 00:01:17.911 line:78%
&gt;&gt; USE SHAVED.

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:20.180 line:78%
&gt;&gt; HAVE TO SLEEP IN THERE.

00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:20.480 line:78%
&gt;&gt; HE DOES THAT SO YOU CAN'T

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:22.449 line:78%
MOVE.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:26.953 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THE GREAT THING I LEARNED

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:28.288 line:78%
ABOUT DOGS IS THEIR POOP AND PEE

00:01:27.053 --> 00:01:30.023 line:78%
DOESN'T SMELL.

00:01:28.455 --> 00:01:31.224 line:78%
I FORGET ABOUT WASHING MY HANDS

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:31.591 line:78%
AFTER A WHILE.

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:32.625 line:78%
[LAUGHTER]

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:33.927 line:78%
&gt;&gt; IT'S STILL TOXIC.

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:36.229 line:78%
&gt;&gt; I HAVE GOOD ADVICE.

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:37.831 line:78%
I DON'T KNOW IF YOU HAVE A ROOM

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:41.167 line:78%
ABOVE, BUT IF YOU DO, NEVER TURN

00:01:38.198 --> 00:01:41.801 line:78%
IT ON WITH THE PUPPY OUT OF THE

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:42.268 line:78%
HOUSE.

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:45.205 line:78%
&gt;&gt; WHAT HAPPENS?

00:01:42.702 --> 00:01:45.772 line:78%
&gt;&gt; IF THE PUPPY HAS AN

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:46.372 line:78%
ACCIDENT...

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:47.774 line:78%
&gt;&gt; OH, NO.

00:01:47.073 --> 00:01:50.009 line:78%
&gt;&gt; YOUR HOUSE WILL SMELL.

00:01:48.475 --> 00:01:51.911 line:78%
&gt;&gt; HAS THAT HAPPENED TO YOU?

00:01:50.877 --> 00:01:53.179 line:78%
&gt;&gt; IT MAY HAS.

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:56.182 line:78%
&gt;&gt; OH, MY GOSH.

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:56.516 line:78%
&gt;&gt; AND RUMBA WANT TO GIVE YOU A

00:01:56.282 --> 00:01:59.786 line:78%
NEW ONE.

00:01:58.284 --> 00:02:00.086 line:78%
&gt;&gt; DO HAVE ADVICE?

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:00.453 line:78%
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:02.589 line:78%
[LAUGHTER]

00:02:00.587 --> 00:02:03.156 line:78%
WHY DID YOU GO WITH THE FRENCH

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:04.023 line:78%
BULLDOG?

00:02:03.256 --> 00:02:05.391 line:78%
THERE IS A RESEMBLANCE.

00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:06.259 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THAT'S THE FIRST THING MY

00:02:05.492 --> 00:02:10.630 line:78%
WIFE SAID.

00:02:06.359 --> 00:02:14.501 line:78%
"LOOKS JUST LIKE YOU."

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:18.638 line:78%
KAT TIMPF, THE BLONDE LADY FROM

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:23.343 line:78%
THE "GUTFELD SHOW," THEIR DOG

00:02:18.738 --> 00:02:26.713 line:78%
IS --

00:02:23.443 --> 00:02:27.680 line:78%
I DO NOT COME OUT DIFFERENT MOM

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:28.148 line:78%
DOGS ARE ALL SLUTS, THEY SLEEP

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.883 line:78%
WITH EVERYBODY.

00:02:28.248 --> 00:02:34.587 line:78%
[LAUGHTER]

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:34.921 line:78%
&gt;&gt; I LEARNED -- I HAVE GOOD

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:37.056 line:78%
ADVICE.

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:38.057 line:78%
THESE MONKS RAISED GERMAN

00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:40.426 line:78%
SHEPHERDS TO BE SERVICE DOGS.

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:41.828 line:78%
IN THE BOOK, THEY HAVE A TIP.

00:02:40.527 --> 00:02:43.696 line:78%
WHEN HE'S OLDER, YOU WANT TO

00:02:41.928 --> 00:02:47.634 line:78%
TAKE HIM TO A PLACE THAT IS

00:02:43.796 --> 00:02:49.169 line:78%
UNFAMILIAR, A WOODED AREA.

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:51.437 line:78%
&gt;&gt; FOR GREG?

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:52.772 line:78%
TAKE THEM TO OUR CHURCH.

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:53.940 line:78%
&gt;&gt; HOW DARE YOU?

00:02:52.872 --> 00:02:57.844 line:78%
&gt;&gt; YOU WANT TO TAKE HIM OFF THE

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:58.111 line:78%
LEASH AND HAVE HIM SIT AROUND

00:02:57.944 --> 00:03:00.046 line:78%
YOU.

00:02:58.211 --> 00:03:02.015 line:78%
&gt;&gt; YOU HAVE HIM DIVE AROUND THE

00:03:00.146 --> 00:03:03.550 line:78%
TREE, WAIT A MOMENT FOR HIM TO

00:03:02.115 --> 00:03:05.852 line:78%
GET NERVOUS WAITING FOR YOU, AND

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:08.188 line:78%
THEN STEP OUT AND SAY "I'M RIGHT

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:10.957 line:78%
HERE," AND HE WILL NEVER TAKE

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:11.257 line:78%
HIS EYES OFF OF YOU AND IT HELPS

00:03:11.057 --> 00:03:12.859 line:78%
A LOT.

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:13.626 line:78%
&gt;&gt; JOE WILL, ANOTHER PIECE OF

00:03:12.959 --> 00:03:14.961 line:78%
ADVICE.

00:03:14.093 --> 00:03:17.063 line:78%
I REMEMBER THIS FROM SCOTT ADAMS

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:17.764 line:78%
TALKING ABOUT HOW TO DEAL WITH

00:03:17.163 --> 00:03:21.434 line:78%
DOGS BARKING, THAT THEY ARE IN

00:03:17.864 --> 00:03:23.503 line:78%
THE SAME LANGUAGE AS YOU.

00:03:21.568 --> 00:03:25.405 line:78%
THE BEST ANALOGY TO A PUPPY OR

00:03:23.603 --> 00:03:26.773 line:78%
DOG BARKING IS WHEN YOU ARE

00:03:25.505 --> 00:03:28.241 line:78%
PRESSING A DOORBELL AND NOBODY

00:03:26.873 --> 00:03:30.310 line:78%
IS HOME OR YOU ARE PRESSING A

00:03:28.608 --> 00:03:30.843 line:78%
BUTTON TO GET A CANDY BAR OUT OF

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:34.247 line:78%
THE VENDING MACHINE.

00:03:31.978 --> 00:03:34.581 line:78%
IT IS NOT -- IT'S JUST PUSHING A

00:03:34.347 --> 00:03:37.784 line:78%
BUTTON.

00:03:34.681 --> 00:03:39.953 line:78%
THAT'S WHAT THEY ARE DOING.

00:03:37.884 --> 00:03:41.654 line:78%
WHEN I THINK ABOUT THAT --

00:03:40.186 --> 00:03:42.155 line:78%
&gt;&gt; IT PUSHES MY BUTTONS.

00:03:41.888 --> 00:03:44.424 line:78%
[LAUGHTER]

00:03:42.388 --> 00:03:45.124 line:78%
&gt;&gt; I HAD TO GET JOHNNY TO ASK

00:03:44.524 --> 00:03:47.493 line:78%
SOMEONE IF THEY COULD HAVE

00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:48.595 line:78%
RICKY --

00:03:47.594 --> 00:03:49.562 line:78%
[LAUGHTER]

00:03:49.295 --> 00:03:52.799 line:78%
&gt;&gt; JESSE!

00:03:50.597 --> 00:03:53.266 line:78%
&gt;&gt; APPARENTLY THAT IS CONSIDERED

00:03:52.899 --> 00:03:53.633 line:78%
BARBARIC.

00:03:53.366 --> 00:03:56.669 line:78%
[LAUGHTER]

00:03:53.733 --> 00:03:57.370 line:78%
&gt;&gt; JESSICA, ANY ADVICE OF WHO IS

00:03:56.769 --> 00:03:59.205 line:78%
RAISING A BABY?

00:03:57.470 --> 00:03:59.639 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THEY ARE DIFFERENT.

00:03:59.305 --> 00:04:01.207 line:78%
[LAUGHTER]

00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:02.642 line:78%
I HAD A DOG WHEN I WAS YOUNGER,

00:04:01.374 --> 00:04:04.577 line:78%
BUT IT'S AMAZING HOW MUCH

00:04:02.742 --> 00:04:06.779 line:78%
ATTENTION THEY ARE GETTING ON

00:04:04.911 --> 00:04:07.180 line:78%
THE STREETS, THAT DOG DOWN TO

00:04:06.879 --> 00:04:09.315 line:78%
THE CORNER.

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:11.517 line:78%
&gt;&gt; WALKED ONTO A PET SHOP AND

00:04:09.482 --> 00:04:15.455 line:78%
HAD THEM.

00:04:11.618 --> 00:04:20.727 line:78%
EVERYBODY THERE -- THE FAME GOES

00:04:15.555 --> 00:04:23.796 line:78%
AWAY FROM YOU TO THIS DOG --

00:04:20.827 --> 00:04:25.431 line:78%
PEOPLE ARE TELLING ME THAT A

00:04:23.896 --> 00:04:25.865 line:78%
CHANGE THEIR LIFE, BUT NOW IT'S

00:04:25.531 --> 00:04:28.434 line:78%
JUST THE DOG.

00:04:25.965 --> 00:04:28.935 line:78%
&gt;&gt; PEOPLE SAY TO ME --

00:04:28.668 --> 00:04:31.571 line:78%
[LAUGHTER]

00:04:29.235 --> 00:04:33.773 line:78%
&gt;&gt; WHEN I AM ALONE, IT'S FANS

00:04:31.671 --> 00:04:35.074 line:78%
FROM SIX TO 5-70-YEAR-OLD

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.441 line:78%
LADIES, BUT WHEN I GOT THE DOG

00:04:35.174 --> 00:04:35.441 line:78%
IT'S ALL THE MODEL

